    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #317\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed successfully to branch `bb/relay-212-implementation-audit-fixes-02-23-add-r-thr_wes8xwzz2f` (fast-forward `6fe697c..ade6338`).\n\n## Summary\n\nPushed the code-review fixes commit addressing all findings from CI check \"code-review\" on PR #317:\n\n- **Medium finding**: documented the per-side `locked` semantics on `CreateRelationPropertyInput` (locking is now independent per side; a caller must set `inverse.locked` explicitly to lock the paired property, whereas the old top-level `locked: true` used to cascade to both sides).\n- **Low findings**: fixed `import/first` violations in `inboxStore.ts`/`inboxTickAction.ts`, corrected misaligned `deleteRelationWithClient(...)` call indentation in `gmailReconcile.ts`/`graphReconcile.ts`, reindented the nested `describe` block in `relations.test.ts`, and switched `mailboxClientView.test.ts`'s relation-writing test helpers to `withTransaction` for consistency.\n\nVerified before pushing: clean `tsc --noEmit`, full monorepo build, 83/83 unit tests, and 403/403 integration tests (real ephemeral Postgres) all passing.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
