    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #317\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed successfully to branch `bb/relay-212-implementation-audit-fixes-02-23-add-r-thr_wes8xwzz2f` (fast-forward `ade6338..9d59f56`).\n\n## Summary\n\nPushed the code-review fix commit addressing the remaining medium and low findings from CI check \"code-review\" on PR #317:\n\n- **Medium finding**: `folders.mailbox`'s inverse (`mailboxes.folders`) and `emails.folder`'s inverse (`folders.emails`) had been left at the default `owner: 'user'`, letting a caller who knew the inverse property's id create/update/delete the same edge without any `EMAILS_MODULE_ID`/`FOLDERS_MODULE_ID` context — bypassing the ownership the source side declared. Both inverses are now explicitly `owner: 'system'` with the matching `ownerProcess`, closing the gap for both affected relations.\n- **Low finding**: simplified `CreateRelationPropertyInput.inverse`'s type from a redundant `Omit<...> & Pick<...>` to plain `RelationPropertySideInput`.\n\nVerified before pushing: clean `tsc --noEmit`, full monorepo build, 83/83 unit tests, and 403/403 integration tests (real ephemeral Postgres) all passing.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
